 "description": "So I'm sitting here at college, and I find someone else who plays this silly game known as Star Wars CCG.  Currently I'm working on getting him back into the game.  This is his first deck in, like, five years.  I think it has some potential, personally.  If you can, keep in mind that this deck will stay classic throughout editing.  Any ideas to make it faster or better?",
